      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Krea2 CcC Text-to-Image workflow with Vision Reference.\\n\\nFlow:\\n- UNETLoader + CLIPLoader -> CcC Krea2 - Text to Image -> sampler path.\\n- Vision Reference declares Semantic, Visual, Style, or Context information; T2I analyzes it into mode-scoped text guidance.\\n- Leave instruction empty to test the preset itself. Use instruction only for additional guidance inside the selected mode.\\n- Semantic and Visual use the full source image. Style can use full, 2x2, or 4x4 analysis.\\n- Context keeps scene/framing/action relationships, not clothing or identity.\\n- Direct Vision rows never enter final T2I conditioning. Negative prompt remains text-only.\\n- Vision Reference is optional; disconnect it for normal text-only T2I."
      ],
      "title": "Workflow Notes"
    },
